{"status":"OK","last_updated":"2026-11-07 14:37:33+00:00","data":{"image":{"name":"minisatip","initial_date":"2016-08-15","github_url":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-minisatip","project_url":"https://github.com/catalinii/minisatip","project_logo":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/linuxserver/docker-templates/master/linuxserver.io/img/minisatip-icon.png","description":"[Minisatip](https://github.com/catalinii/minisatip) is a multi-threaded satip server version 1.2 that runs under Linux and it was tested with DVB-S, DVB-S2, DVB-T, DVB-T2, DVB-C, DVB-C2, ATSC and ISDB-T cards.","version":"v2.0.189-ls5","version_timestamp":"2026-11-04 23:38:46+00:00","category":"Media Tools","stable":true,"deprecated":false,"stars":0,"tags":[{"tag":"latest","desc":"Stable releases"}],"architectures":[{"arch":"x86_64","tag":"amd64-latest"},{"arch":"arm64","tag":"arm64v8-latest"}],"changelog":[{"date":"2026-02-20","desc":"Build with cmake. Clean up source files."},{"date":"2025-06-10","desc":"Remove dvb-apps as upstream repo no longer exists."},{"date":"2025-05-21","desc":"Rebase to Ubuntu Noble as the new upstream version requires glibc."},{"date":"2024-06-30","desc":"Rebase to Alpine 3.20."},{"date":"2023-12-08","desc":"Rebase to Alpine 3.19, switch to building from releases rather than commits."},{"date":"2023-07-26","desc":"Build with DDCI=1 for Digital Devices CI support."},{"date":"2023-07-03","desc":"Deprecate armhf. As announced [here](https://www.linuxserver.io/blog/a-farewell-to-arm-hf)"},{"date":"2022-11-12","desc":"Rebasing to alpine 3.137, upgrading to s6v3."},{"date":"2021-01-23","desc":"Rebasing to alpine 3.13."},{"date":"2020-06-01","desc":"Rebasing to alpine 3.12."},{"date":"2019-12-19","desc":"Rebasing to alpine 3.11."},{"date":"2019-06-28","desc":"Rebasing to alpine 3.10."},{"date":"2019-03-23","desc":"Switching to new Base images, shift to arm32v7 tag."},{"date":"2019-02-22","desc":"Rebasing to alpine 3.9."},{"date":"2019-02-20","desc":"Fix run opti